  "Stem": "Hawthorne Components must update the debt component of WACC for its Q3 board review. Treasurer Priya Desai notes the outstanding 10-year bonds trade at a yield to maturity of 7.20% and carry a 5.90% coupon set at issuance when rates were lower. The firm's marginal tax rate is 24%. Ms. Desai must determine the correct after-tax cost of debt that reflects the current market cost and the interest tax shield under IRC §163. Which after-tax cost is appropriate for WACC?",
